+
+## How verified (commands → exit codes)
+
+| Command | Exit | Result |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `make e2e-task TASK=T-101` (run first) | 0 | 0 tests — drafts inert, as expected |
+| `go mod tidy -diff` | 0 | go.mod/go.sum exactly tidy before commit |
