+| `gofmt -l internal migrations cmd` | 0 | no output |
+| `make lint` | 0 | `0 issues` (cyclop ≤15, errcheck, sqlclosecheck, noctx, gosec…) |
+| `make generate` (twice) | 0 | sqlc v1.31.1; byte-stable output |
+| `git commit -m "feat(store): …"` | 0 | `6e7ae1d`; gitleaks+gofmt+conventional hooks green |
+| `make check-fast` | **0** | fmt-check (tidy, no drift), vet, lint `0 issues`, full `-race -shuffle` suite |
+| `make generate-check` | 0 | committed gen matches regeneration (`git diff --exit-code -- internal/store/gen`) |
+| `make phase-grep` | 0 | no "Phase N" under `migrations/` |
