+4. T-100's open issue stands: `.gitignore` lacks `test-run.db` /
+   `test-run-photos/`; once T-103 wires the binary to open `DB_PATH`,
+   Playwright webServer runs will leave untracked files in worker worktrees.
+5. `applied_at` is RFC3339 UTC; recorded checksums are lowercase hex and the
+   uppercase-tamper subtest pins strict (case-sensitive) equality — a
+   case-insensitive guard would silently pass tampered DBs.
